{{/*
  BuildIT operator alert template.

  Times are rendered in India Standard Time. Grafana Cloud runs its scheduler in UTC and
  `.StartsAt` carries a UTC instant, so the offset is applied explicitly: 5h30m expressed as
  nanoseconds for time.Time.Add. The zone suffix is deliberately omitted from the layout and
  " IST" appended, because Add shifts the instant without relabelling the location: printing a
  zone here would say UTC and contradict the shifted clock.
*/}}

